	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Vehementer doleo, pater observandissime, nihil amplius iam a longo tempore <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>me a vobis accipere.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Id qui fiat aut qua ratione commeruerim, adhuc <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ignoro.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Is enim ero semper, qui, quos deus mihi maiores, quos patres reverend<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>os dedit, illis per omnia morem geram.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Si quid offendit inconsultus abitus <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>meus<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p8459">Werdmüller</persName> hatte <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> offenbar schon zu Ende des Jahres 1539 verlassen; er war in <placeName ref="l378">Paris</placeName>, als Kaiser <persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName> Anfang Januar 1540 dort einzog (s. unten Z. 9-11 mit Anm. 2).</note>, vel hoc nomine veniam spero, quod a nemine revocatus in patriam <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>longius discessi nec ob aliam causam reliqui <placeName ref="l28">Basileam</placeName>, nisi ut et <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>alios disciplinarum professores audirem, quorum magnus est <placeName ref="l378">Lutetiae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>numerus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Atque ut studia literarum ommittam, vidimus regiam <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>pompam et plusquam regiam, qua <persName ref="p18538">Carolus</persName> imperator tum in aliis <lb xml:id="p1z10"/><placeName ref="l832">Galliae</placeName> partibus, tum vero<pb type="edition" next="97"/> <placeName ref="l378">Parrisiis</placeName> exceptus est<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Kaiser <persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName> weilte vom 1. bis 7. Januar 1540 in <placeName ref="l378">Paris</placeName>; s. <hi>Stälin 574; Brandi</hi> I 365 und II 291.</note>.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Conspicias ibi revera, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>quod de <placeName ref="l425">Roma</placeName> iactabatur: urbem et orbem<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Vgl. <bibl source="b473">Otto</bibl> 358f, Nr. 1834.</note>, quo nihil illustrius <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>uno et altero quodam<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>vor</hi> quodam <hi>gestrichenes</hi> quib.</note> dempto in universa (quod ego sciam) <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>extat <placeName ref="l822">Germania</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Sed sanctissima negotia tua nugis istis obtundo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Breviter in festis pascatis<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Ostern (28. März 1540).</note> <placeName ref="l378">Lutetia</placeName> relicta <placeName ref="l367">Aureliam</placeName> veni, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ubi iam iterum honesta conditione fruor rhetoricem praelegendo.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Consti<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>tuique literas tuas vere paternas hic expectare, ut sciam, quid porro <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>sit agendum.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Nam quidam <placeName ref="l378">Parrisiis</placeName> mihi summe amicus pollicitus <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>est se scire dominum quendam in <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Weder der Freund noch der Herr in <placeName ref="l830">England</placeName> sind weiter bekannt.</note>, apud quem ho<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>neste vivam nihil aliud quam mathematicam docens, unde, si libeat eo <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>proficisci, daturum se cum viatico etiam equum.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Ego vero differre consultius <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>arbitror, donec literis tuis certior factus fuero, utrum ex <lb xml:id="p1z22"/><placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> penitius introspecta fructum aliquem percipere possimus.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Nam pro tua prudentia non potes ignorare, quantam non dico voluptatem, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>sed etiam utilitatem capimus e longinqua et diuturna peregrinatione.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Sed haec tota est sita in vestro arbitrio, cui lubens acquiescam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale cum <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>tua familia, cum d. <persName ref="p8127">Pellicano</persName>, d. <persName ref="p8171">Theodoro</persName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note>, d. <persName ref="p167">Ammanio</persName> et reliquis omnibus <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>dominis et praeceptoribus meis.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">1540, 18. aprilis, <placeName ref="l367">Aureliae</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/><persName ref="p8459">Otho Werdmüllerus</persName> tibi deditissimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro domino <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrico Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>patri suo in perpetuum <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>colendo.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/><placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
